This product is an open-source community tool for visualizing thermal mapping
studies. It is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The built-in audit trail is a lightweight record of user actions. It is NOT a
21 CFR Part 11 compliance feature and no electronic signatures are provided.

This product bundles Qt (via PySide6, LGPL) and other open-source libraries;
see pyproject.toml for the full dependency list and their respective licenses.